# Cursor Rules - MANDATORY

ALWAYS read AGENTS.md, CODING_STANDARDS.md, CONTRIBUTING.md first.

MANDATORY GATES - MUST PASS:
- make lint
- make typecheck
- make imports
- make arch-test
- make test
- make test-security

ENFORCEMENT:
- One class per file
- mypy --strict clean
- import-linter all KEPT
- No vendor in domain/app
- company_id required
- Decimal for money
- Constructor injection

NO SHORTCUTS. FIX ALL FAILURES.
